nguage":"en-US","title":"In a Better World","overview":"The lives of two Danish families cross each other, and an extraordinary but risky friendship comes into bud. But loneliness, frailty and sorrow lie in wait."},{"language":"da-DA","overview":"Anton arbejder som læge i en nødhjælpsorganisation og pendler mellem en flygtningelejr i Afrika og sit hjem i Danmark, hvor han har to små sønner. Han har svigtet sin elskede kone Marianne, og de prøver nu at vænne sig til et liv uden hinanden. Sideløbende begynder deres 10-årige søn Elias at blive venner med den nye dreng i klassen, den velhavende Claus' søn Christian. Dette umage venskab udvikler sig snart til en foruroligende alliance, som truer med at ødelægge landsbyidyllen for altid."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVt2mm4ztXTCRNy75EGi72EdMUe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jso7QKHWwkdlEHFef68kFWHsltx.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":44716,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"da-DA","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVt2mm4ztXTCRNy75EGi72EdMUe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jVt2mm4ztXTCRNy75EGi72EdMUe.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVt2mm4ztXTCRNy75EGi72EdMUe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jVt2mm4ztXTCRNy75EGi72EdMUe.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJpPpgf2z5lNw6xVxvfWm0lexNH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dJpPpgf2z5lNw6xVxvfWm0lexNH.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJpPpgf2z5lNw6xVxvfWm0lexNH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org